  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8e70547d8134d5943ac3fafcae79c9dc, type: 3}
  m_Name: BanditsOnRoad
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::EventData
  title: An encounter on the road
  description: 'As you walk to the village, you notice a carriage coming your way.
    The carriage is being dragged by a single horse. There are five hooded men acompanying
    it. Olaf and Wagner don''t seem nervous but you never know. Soon they arrive
    at the talking distance, some dwarvish words are exchanged, you notice one of
    the hooded men discreetly show a few signs with his hand. '
  image: {fileID: 0}
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
  choices:
  - choiceText: (Abdul) Show a sign as an answer
    outcomeText: Abdul recognized this sign as a sign of peace between thieves, answering
      it means a truce between both parties. It seems unnecesary bloodshed can be
      avoided
    goldChange: 0
    hpChangePercent: 0
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems: []
    costItems: []
  - choiceText: Ignore the men
    outcomeText: This seemed like a normal interaction between northerners, you didn't
      want to concern yourself with this. After some time has passed you notice that
      some coin is missing from your pouch... (-100)
    goldChange: -100
    hpChangePercent: 0
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems: []
    costItems: []
  - choiceText: Be cautious but descreet while they pass
    outcomeText: You ignored the sign, but remained suspicious of these men. Just
      as they pass you, you notice one of them try to pickpocket you. Answering with
      retalliation you beat the thieves and take some of their stuff. After all it's
      only fair.
    goldChange: 250
    hpChangePercent: 20
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems: []
    costItems: []
